  <metadata>
    <name>Madrid to Segovia — road driving track</name>
    <desc>Driving route from Plaza de Cibeles, Madrid, to Avenida del Acueducto, near the aqueduct, Segovia. Distance: 91.9 km. Full-resolution planned road geometry from the OSRM driving profile, using OpenStreetMap data. May include motorways and toll roads. Elevations are terrain-model estimates in metres above sea level, bilinearly sampled from Terrarium terrain tiles at zoom 13 through oms.rbel.co. Terrain elevations can differ from the road surface at tunnels and bridges.</desc>
